op: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;대학생 청소년교육지원장학금사업이란?</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;▶ 대학생이 초중고등학생에게 학습지도 등 멘토링 활동을 하고&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">이에 대해 국가에서 학생에게 장학금을 지급하는 제도</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp; → 대학생 멘토는 지식과 경험을 나누는 가치있는 근로 기회를 가지고,&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">활동 기관은 소속 초중고등학생에게 양질의 멘토링 수혜 기회 제공</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif;\"><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 1rem; line-height: 1.2; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><br></p></span><p style=\"font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">1. 모집인원 : 45명</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;\">2. 신청기간:</span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;2025. 3. 12.(수) 10:00 ~&nbsp;</span><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">3. 26</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">.(수</span></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0); font-size: 11pt;\">) 18:00</span></span></b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(9, 0, 255);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\"><br></span></span></b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">3. 신청방법 :</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - (홈페이지)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">한국장학재단 홈페이지-인재육성-대학생지식멘토링-대학생청소년교육지원 사업-사업신청</span></b></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - (모</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">바</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">일</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">) 한국장학재단 어플-인재육성-대학생지식 멘토링-대학생 청소년교육지원 사업-신청하기</span></b></span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">4.&nbsp;신청자격 및 선발기준</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 재학생</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 별도의 소득기준은 없으며, 직전학기 성적이 70점(100점 만점) 이상인 자</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 신</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">·</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">편입생은 첫 학기에 한해 성적기준 미적용</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - \"기 사업 참여자 - 저학년&gt;고학년 - 성적 상위자\" 순으로 선발&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">5. 활동기간 : 선발 후~2026</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">년 2</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">월(<span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 187, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">예산사정에 따라 일정&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\"><span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 187, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">변경 가능</span>)</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">6. 활동기관&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">※&nbsp;</span></b></span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><b><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 0, 0);\">실제 활동가능여부를 기관에 전화로 확인 후 지원 바람</span></b></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">전국 초중고등학교</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><u><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">※&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">어린이집</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">유치원</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt; color: rgb(0, 0, 0);\">노인복지시설 등 활동 불가</span></u></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 지역아동센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">학교 밖 청소년지원센터</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">, VMS·1365(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">정부인증포털</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">)&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">등록시설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">청소년방과후아카데미 운영시설</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">한국청소년활동진흥원 인증</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; text-indent: -29.3333px; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 한국장학재단</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;<b>[멘토발굴형 B형]</b>&nbsp;선발된 학생이 희망하는 기관을 방문하여&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">기관 담당자에게 활동&nbsp;승인을 받고 활동 진행</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 신규근로기관에 대해서는 멘토가 대학으로 기관등록 신청서를 제출&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">7. 활동장소 : 반드시 근로기관 내에서 활동</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">8. 활동내용 : 교과목 학습지도 등​</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">국어․영어․수학 등 교과목 학습지도 및 예체능 지도 등 특기적성 교육</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">진로지도 및 고민상담, 자기주도 학습법 및 학습 동기부여 활동 등 활동기관․대학․멘토가 멘티에게 필요한 활동이라고 동의한 경우 활동으로 인정</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (단, 근로기관 업무보조(단순노무) 등의 활동은 인정하지 않음)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; -&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">멘토링 활동은 반드시 활동기관 내에서 진행되어야 함</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (단, 사전에 활동기관․대학․멘토 간 협의가 이루어진 경우, 활동(근태) 관리자의 관리가 가능한 범위 내에서 활동 장소 확대 가능)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">9. 활동시간</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 10시간 미만의 활동에 대해서는 인정되지 않음</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; ※ 예산 사정에 의해 활동시간을 제한할 수 있음​</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 1일 최대 8시간</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 주당최대 20시간(방학중은 40시간)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 학기당 최대 640시간</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">10. 근로장학금액: 근로 다음달 20일 지급(시간당 급여 12,430원)</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">11.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">유의사항</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 봉사시간 인정&nbsp;(중복)가능</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 국가근로장학금사업과 중복 참여 불가</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 직전학기에 징계처분을 받은 학생, 수업연한을 초과한 학생, 휴학생, 제적생, 자퇴생, 현장실습생 참여&nbsp;불가</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 학적변동자(휴학, 제적, 졸업)는 장학금 지급 불가, <span style=\"background-color: rgb(255, 187, 0); color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">학적변동 시 반드시 학생성공처로 연락(054-478-7046)</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; - 해외체류 및 군복무기간에는 출근부 입력 금지</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">12. 향후 일정</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- (학교) 선발</span><span style=\"font-size: 11pt;\">(예정): 3. 28.(금) 개별연락 [KIT톡 안내, 국립금오공대&nbsp;앱 설치 후 푸시알림 동의 필수]</span></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- (학생) 희망근로지 신청 및 학업시간표 입력, 온라인 사전교육 이수</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- (학교) 기관매칭</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp;- (학생) 기관 담당자와 협의 후 업무스케줄 작성, 근로진행</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\"><br></span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">붙임 1.&nbsp;활동가능 근로기관 찾기 매뉴얼 1부.</span></p><p style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 2. 대학생 청소년교육지원사업 멘토 시스템 매뉴얼 1부.&nbsp;끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
